meta {
  name: Get Patient Facesheets
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients/:patientId/facesheets
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Gets a list of facesheets for the patient by ID. Facesheets with structured output include a `requestId` for retrieving that output, and their `images` contain the all-referenced-records PDF when available. Partner-facing document display text fields are returned without literal `|` separators. Identifiers, URLs, statuses, dates, splice metadata, and source metadata are preserved as received.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `patientId` | Unique identifier of the patient. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  {
    "partnerPatientId": "6ed9a868-6558-263a-49c8-8fe8f8083434",
    "facesheets": [
      {
        "id": "d5715c1a-667c-75a6-37d8-85e2fb14587a",
        "name": "string",
        "date": "1959-02-01",
        "title": "Patient Facesheet",
        "createdAt": "1960-09-22T06:57:09.257Z",
        "images": [
          {
            "id": "dd3d4f4e-8eff-56f3-6b8a-698e72ac950d",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "2021-03-26T06:09:14.798Z"
          },
          {
            "id": "709020e0-4968-ddbb-c2a9-1dfcfbf1f34b",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "1960-11-26T09:05:41.946Z"
          }
        ],
        "requestId": "51b8c754-06d7-5125-d2b6-ec1a9934eeae"
      },
      {
        "id": "a0ef2f5c-c454-440a-b540-724155048775",
        "name": "string",
        "date": "1970-02-07",
        "title": "Patient Facesheet",
        "createdAt": "1951-10-01T09:30:32.845Z",
        "images": [
          {
            "id": "f6b78b38-8ed7-8fa4-4bb2-785c1f763008",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "1990-12-11T19:24:23.506Z"
          },
          {
            "id": "2e4c4833-12cf-083c-404d-3fd28edb3a9f",
            "url": "https://example.com/document.pdf",
            "createdAt": "2017-08-23T11:07:05.320Z"
          }
        ],
        "requestId": "fac78e95-ecc7-b019-ebe4-fc1b3457dc62"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
